# Proposal

## The problem (problem)
For each of this prototype's own checks, name a rewrite of an input under which the check's verdict ought to move. Propose a kernel, a transform, and an input. The executor will run it; the catalogue says which pairs anyone has written down already. A pair that moves and is not catalogued is a boundary nobody has recorded; a pair the catalogue says moves and that does not move is a defect in the catalogue.

